@LegalManager_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133

### 1. Crear cliente (te devuelve su id)
POST {{LegalManager_HostAddress}}/api/user/client
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Perez",
  "dni": "30111222",
  "email": "juan@mail.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "phone": "11-5555",
  "address": "Calle 1"
}

### 2. Crear abogado (te devuelve su id)
POST {{LegalManager_HostAddress}}/api/user/lawyer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Gomez",
  "dni": "29333444",
  "email": "ana@mail.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "barNumber": "MP123",
  "phone": "11-6666",
  "specialties": ["civil", "laboral"]
}

### 3. Listar usuarios (acá copiás los ids de cliente y abogado)
GET {{LegalManager_HostAddress}}/api/user
Accept: application/json

### 4. Crear expediente (REEMPLAZÁ los GUID-... por los ids reales)
POST {{LegalManager_HostAddress}}/api/case
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseNumber": "EXP-001",
  "title": "Divorcio",
  "area": "civil",
  "startDate": "2026-09-08",
  "description": "Divorcio express",
  "notes": "",
  "clientId": "a0e3d64b-6ee8-466f-8d36-405533ffcfb2",
  "lawyerId": "5a3db09d-f390-4df6-abbb-23cbb2bb4251",
  "createdByUserId": "5a3db09d-f390-4df6-abbb-23cbb2bb4251"
}

### 5. Listar expedientes (verificar que trae lawyerIds)
GET {{LegalManager_HostAddress}}/api/case
Accept: application/json

### 6. Disponibilidad del abogado (REEMPLAZÁ el GUID)
GET {{LegalManager_HostAddress}}/api/appointment/availability?lawyerId=5a3db09d-f390-4df6-abbb-23cbb2bb4251&date=2026-09-15
Accept: application/json